30
00: 07: 05,192 --> 00: 07: 08,234
- Yes.
- You are.

31
00: 07: 09,276 --> 00: 07: 13,068
Can you say,
that this is a mini version of the European

32
00: 07: 13,234 --> 00: 07: 16,986
