198
00: 25: 36,743 --> 00: 25: 40,786
Stay where you are.
You are safe now. Look at me.

199
00: 25: 40,952 --> 00: 25: 46,701
They'll probably get the fire on. The
get us out. Just breathe normally.

200
00: 25: 46,868 --> 00: 25: 49,536
