201
00: 25: 49,703 --> 00: 25: 52,994
Okay, it's gonna go.

202
00: 26: 08,702 --> 00: 26: 13,703
Okay, it's gonna go.

203
00: 27: 15,248 --> 00: 27: 18,955
Hey. Hey!

204
00: 27: 20,123 --> 00: 27: 24,997
